Implementation: DeepDives/2026-10-31-sly-csharp-parser-deep-dive.html; tools/BuildSlyDeepDive.cs; docs/sly-deep-dive. Verification: tests/sly-deep-dive.test.cjs, local C# laboratory tests, catalog checks and browser inspection recorded in verification.json. Draft describes the educational slice rather than complete Sly/SPICE qualification.
